      "agreement_caveat": "mlotst is a model-diagnosed field produced by each model's own mixed-layer algorithm, reference-depth convention, vertical discretization and temporal averaging. The offline operator here uses EOS-80 potential density at p=0, a surface reference density, first crossing of the 0.03 kg m-3 threshold, and linear interpolation between level centres. It also uses monthly mean thetao/so and therefore cannot reproduce sub-monthly mixing events. Nonzero differences are therefore expected even for the same simulation; they diagnose algorithm and discretization differences, not model physics."
